<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Grintek lifts half year share, div.</title>
<headline>Grintek lifts half year share, div.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year ended December 31 (million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>Pre-excep shr, attrib (cts)  12.0  vs 10.4</p>
<p>    Post-excep shr (cts)	   10.3  vs 12.2</p>
<p>    Div (cts)		 2.3	   vs 2.0</p>
<p>    Pre-tax		   54.45	 vs    61.50</p>
<p>    Tax			 15.59	 vs    16.77</p>
<p>    Interest paid	    2.21	 vs     5.44</p>
<p>    Turnover	     1,076.62	 vs 1,042.62</p>
<p>Full name: Grintek Ltd</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	2.89 loss  vs     6.37 profit</p>
<p>NOTE - The firm said that it would declare dividend dates at a later date. It added that it was cautiously optimistic about prospects for the rest of the current financial year.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
